9","start":29.02,"end":29.67,"text":"は〜い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":29.67,"end":31.41,"text":"花鳥風月 風林火山","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":31.41,"end":31.99,"text":"それだ〜！（おぉ〜）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":31.99,"end":33.85,"text":"ドレッシング パスタにハンバーグ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":33.85,"end":34.68,"text":"な、なんだと（あぁ〜）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":34.68,"end":36.99,"text":"おなかすいた〜 拙者も〜 甘味処みっけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":36.99,"end":39.26,"text":"ほぉ〜うまそうだな ...じゃね〜わ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":39.26,"end":40.85,"text":"と、申されますと？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":40.85,"end":42.65,"text":"モウサレマスト？...え？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":42.65,"end":45.15,"text":"こ～んこ～ん こんがらって こんがらがって候！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":45.15,"end":47.55,"text":"ら～ん ら～ん お目目も乱痴気騒ぎ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":47.55,"end":47.98,"text":"ぱっ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":47.98,"end":50.64,"text":"ちゃーん ちゃーん ちゃんばら イズ ジャパニーズヒーロー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":50.64,"end":51.81,"text":"くせものじゃ〜 何奴だ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":51.81,"end":53.47,"text":"世直しじゃ～！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":53.47,"end":58.52,"text":"少年少女の夢、一つ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":58.52,"end":61.03,"text":"翔んで 笑って 唄って 誇れ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":61.03,"end":63.75,"text":"世直しの音頭でおどりゃんせ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":63.75,"end":68.27,"text":"不届きものちゃんはひかえおろ〜","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":68.27,"end":69.08,"text":"はっはぁ～","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":69.08,"end":72.99,"text":"泣けど笑えど この世は情け 夢路は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":72.99,"end":74.19,"text":"みちづれじゃ～",