99999,"end":113.15,"text":"て～ん て～ん てんてこまい てんてこまいで候！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":113.15,"end":115.35,"text":"ら～ん ら～ん お目目もぱっちりちゃんです！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":115.35,"end":115.88,"text":"かっ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":115.88,"end":118.55,"text":"ちょ～ん ちょ～ん ちょんまげ イズ ジャパニーズヒーロー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":118.55,"end":119.2,"text":"くせものじゃ～","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":119.2,"end":119.72999999999999,"text":"なにものだ～","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":119.72999999999999,"end":121.38,"text":"世直しじゃ～","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":121.38,"end":126.34,"text":"正義の味方はやめられねぇ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":126.34,"end":128.98,"text":"翔んで 笑って 唄って 誇れ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":128.98,"end":131.65,"text":"頭はがらんどう こともなし","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":131.65,"end":136.34,"text":"今宵は無礼講 たのしめや～","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":136.34,"end":136.97,"text":"ははぁ～","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":136.97,"end":139.67000000000002,"text":"誰ぞ彼ぞ老いも若きも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":139.67000000000002,"end":140.95,"text":"まとめて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":140.95,"end":142.06,"text":"お相手だ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":142.06,"end":145.56,"text":"笹の葉 さらさら 月明かりよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":145.56,"end":147.26,"text":"我らを照らせよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":147.26,"end":150.56,"text":"すべての願いをつなぐんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":150.56,"end":153.23,"text":"邪魔者には Say good Bye","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":153.23,"end":155.8,"text":"くるしゅうない 狂乱しちゃって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":155.8,"end":158.44,"text":"我らちょっと 和風に酔いしれちゃって","translation":"","kind":"lyric